{
  "name": "dsh-model-balance",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "在 DSH 客户端固定位置常驻显示当前模型服务的余额与峰谷时段，并以 host 侧 Service 的形式保留接入第三方模型服务的扩展点。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "types": "types/index.d.ts",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/b1essing-guy/dsh-model-balance.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/b1essing-guy/dsh-model-balance#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/b1essing-guy/dsh-model-balance/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./src/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "lib",
    "types",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build-client.js",
    "test": "node scripts/build-client.js && node --test-isolation=none --test \"tests/*.test.js\"",
    "check": "node scripts/build-client.js && node --test-isolation=none --test \"tests/*.test.js\"",
    "prepack": "node scripts/build-client.js"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "balance",
    "peak-valley",
    "cordis"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-default-model": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-account-platform": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": ">=0.1.0-rc.1 <0.2.0-0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-account-platform": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "_comment": [
    "main -> src/index.js：host 半边直接是 ESM 源码，无构建步骤（DSH 宿主加载器按 main 解析）。",
    "exports['./client'] -> lib/client.js：client 半边必须是**单文件**（浏览器侧只经",
    "  window.__ModuleLoader__.load({factory}) 装配，factory 的 require 仅认平台种子模块，",
    "  不能用相对 import），因此由 scripts/build-client.js 把 src/shared 的计价内核内联后产出。",
    "dsh.bundle.patch：声明本包是 bundle，安装后自动进配置层栈。",
    "dsh.client：声明浏览器半边的平台注入与平台（对齐 DSH 客户端插件既有装配）。",
    "刻意不声明 peerDependencies：本包运行时只经 ctx 取服务、只经 factory 的 require 取 react，",
    "  不 import 任何 @deepseek-ai/*，避免安装期产生解析这些内部包的需求。"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
